---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy — Tip Calculator With Tax"
	description="How Tip Calculator With Tax handles your data: everything runs in your browser, and nothing about your bill is sent to us."
	path="/privacy/"
>
	<Header />
	<main id="main" class="page">
		<div class="container page__inner">
			<p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
			<h1 class="page__title">Privacy policy</h1>
			<p class="page__meta">Last updated: 20 October 2026</p>

			<div class="prose">
				<h2>Short version</h2>
				<p>
					Tip Calculator With Tax does not ask for your name, your email, or your bill. Every
					calculation happens inside your own browser, and the numbers you type are never sent
					to our servers.
				</p>

				<h2>What we collect</h2>
				<p>
					We do not collect personal information. We do not operate accounts, and we do not ask
					you to create one. The calculator stores a small amount of preference data in your
					browser's local storage:
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Your chosen currency</li>
					<li>Your rounding preference</li>
					<li>Your light or dark theme choice</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					These settings never leave your device, and clearing your browser storage removes them
					for good.
				</p>

				<h2>Your bill amounts</h2>
				<p>
					The bill amount, tip percentage and number of people you enter are held in memory in
					the browser tab only. They are not transmitted, not logged, and not stored on any
					server. Refreshing or closing the page clears them.
				</p>

				<h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
				<p>
					The site is designed to be fast and unobtrusive. We use privacy-respecting, cookie-free
					measurement to understand which pages are useful. No advertising trackers or
					third-party advertising cookies are set.
				</p>

				<h2>Links to other sites</h2>
				<p>
					Where we link to another website, that site has its own privacy policy. We are not
					responsible for how third-party sites handle your information.
				</p>

				<h2>Contact</h2>
				<p>
					Questions about this policy can be sent to
					<a href="mailto:hello@tipcalculatorwithtax.com">hello@tipcalculatorwithtax.com</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>
